# Product boundary

shippin.tech is the open product and the brand. shippin.cloud is later paid hosting of the same server, not a second mail engine.

This repository is the Rust mail and groupware engine: SMTP, IMAP, JMAP, POP3, ManageSieve, CalDAV, and CardDAV.

## Current work

Map the hosted-mail experience onto JMAP, CalDAV, and the directory that already exist (roadmap phase `zoho-client`). The open scale path (FoundationDB + S3 + NATS or Redis) is the agreed multi-node default.

Do not add, in this phase:

- a Go control plane
- a second mail server, including Mox, Postfix, or Dovecot
- a collaborative Docs editor (Google Docs / Zoho Writer style)

Mox is a product reference only. Do not port it or run it beside this server.

Webmail, calendar UI, contacts UI, and admin UI belong to the Zoho client map and may be added only as clients of the existing JMAP, CalDAV, CardDAV, and directory surfaces.

## Docs later

Collaborative document editing stays out of scope until mail, calendar, contacts, and admin clients exist on those surfaces. File storage via JMAP/WebDAV is not Docs.
